#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
Proxmox Auto-Update — web control service.

Serves a small control panel on its own HTTPS port. The Proxmox web UI gets a
toolbar button (see patch-webui.sh) that opens this page in a window, so none of
the update logic has to live inside pve-manager's own files.

Authentication reuses Proxmox's session: the caller must present a valid
PVEAuthCookie, which is verified against the local PVE API on every request.
Only members of ALLOWED_USERS may do anything at all.

Standard library only — Proxmox ships Python 3 but no extra packages.
"""

